Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product bundles the following third-party datasets under the
`data/` directory for use by the test suite, benchmarks, and
documentation:

  - `data/air-routes-small.{graphml,json,kryo}` — derived from the
    *Air Routes* graph by Kelvin R. Lawrence, distributed as part of
    the *Practical Gremlin* book and its companion repository at
    https://github.com/krlawrence/graph. Redistributed with
    attribution as a fixture for this project's tests and tutorials.
    See `data/README.md` for details.

